4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mG612EpTeyIQ7kNvwFHhnmQ&_nc_oc=AdrfZ02C5ghIcczRVCJqJ2PgoZhX-dLUm10AEBmFYteTtcRYXDUhbbJlKIEtTV2Vcio&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1x9AI0ODk08Qhbw9XtuBuG2pBKcZA9g-huBGT6bWU73w&oe=69E0DE54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Hy1ZIrF_P6cQ7kNvwFsw0Gp&_nc_oc=AdrmDeBFz_NEDOaTrZchXdp9mtjM_CrFNa8t6hx3gMXH2jYbuPsLk9CXjfBmr2MThUU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3k6EG7LqseoDj3doyCRJdTVr75hEd7bCANU-vkj7n25g&oe=69E0E332"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j8XpEe1wZM8Q7kNvwH1KG9m&_nc_oc=AdonRsyPWCYqkJRypb_cHl-9St6pusCuwZ5wsWUPyQWx5zxlpBgfzBCZx46qrbBLEXo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1Ur_ZXfbYstE0RN62TwHlWueX7SDv3UCI8zMEKH8AQnw&oe=69E0F0D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p